WEBVTT

00:00:04.307 --> 00:00:05.349
There she is.

00:00:05.433 --> 00:00:06.350
Ellie.

00:00:06.434 --> 00:00:07.351
ELLIE: Manny.

00:00:07.435 --> 00:00:10.021
(dinosaurs hissing)

00:00:12.273 --> 00:00:13.733
I need to get to her.

00:00:13.816 --> 00:00:15.693
Listen, I'll protect Ellie.

00:00:15.776 --> 00:00:17.445
-You stop those guys.
-But...

00:00:17.528 --> 00:00:20.197
Manny, if they reach her,
it'll be too late.

00:00:20.281 --> 00:00:21.657
You have to trust me.

00:00:24.076 --> 00:00:25.619
(hissing continues)

00:00:25.703 --> 00:00:27.330
All right, let's do it.

00:00:28.039 --> 00:00:29.206
(growls)

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:31.459
(hissing)

00:00:33.544 --> 00:00:35.212
(growls)

00:00:35.296 --> 00:00:37.590
(grunting)

00:00:38.507 --> 00:00:39.425
(yells)

00:00:39.508 --> 00:00:42.428
(dinosaur hissing, Diego panting)

00:00:46.599 --> 00:00:48.684
Ooh... ooh.

00:00:48.768 --> 00:00:51.354
(Diego gasping)

00:00:52.688 --> 00:00:56.108
(panting and grunting)

00:00:56.192 --> 00:00:57.109
(roars)

00:00:59.528 --> 00:01:01.364
(dinosaur hisses, Diego yells)

00:01:01.447 --> 00:01:03.199
(whimpering)

00:01:03.282 --> 00:01:06.494
Whoo, my paws are burning.
Baby, they're burning.

00:01:06.577 --> 00:01:08.704
I gotta tiptoe.
Tippy-toe, tippy-toe.

00:01:08.788 --> 00:01:10.664
ELLIE:
Excuse me, twinkle toes.

00:01:10.748 --> 00:01:11.957
Giving birth here.

00:01:12.041 --> 00:01:14.293
-Oh, right, sorry.
-(grunting)

00:01:14.377 --> 00:01:15.252
You okay?

00:01:15.336 --> 00:01:16.754
Am I okay?

00:01:16.837 --> 00:01:18.798
Do you know anything about childbirth?

00:01:18.881 --> 00:01:21.467
No, not really, but Manny's coming.

00:01:21.550 --> 00:01:22.927
(dinosaurs hissing, Manny grunts)

00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:24.095
(groans)

00:01:25.179 --> 00:01:27.598
(dinosaurs hissing)

00:01:27.681 --> 00:01:28.808
(screaming)

00:01:28.891 --> 00:01:30.976
Diego, I'm scared.

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:32.353
Can I hold your paw?

00:01:32.436 --> 00:01:33.437
Yeah, of cour...

00:01:33.521 --> 00:01:34.522
(both grunt)

00:01:34.605 --> 00:01:36.440
-Just... go with the pain.
-(squeals)

00:01:36.524 --> 00:01:37.483
(screams)

00:01:37.566 --> 00:01:38.901
-I-It's just a contraction.
-No.

00:01:38.984 --> 00:01:40.152
(screams)

00:01:40.236 --> 00:01:41.821
-Huh?
-(hissing)

00:01:41.904 --> 00:01:42.863
(growling)

00:01:45.741 --> 00:01:47.118
(Diego grunting)

00:01:47.201 --> 00:01:48.160
(whimpers)

00:01:48.244 --> 00:01:49.286
(others hissing)

00:01:49.370 --> 00:01:50.788
Whoa.

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:54.583
Look. He's right there.

00:01:54.667 --> 00:01:55.584
BUCK:
Roger.

00:01:55.668 --> 00:01:56.544
No, Sid.

00:01:56.627 --> 00:01:58.254
I know. Roger.

00:01:58.337 --> 00:02:01.215
How about we get Sid first
and then go back for Roger?

00:02:01.298 --> 00:02:02.925
Oh... never mind.

00:02:03.008 --> 00:02:04.969
-Yah!
-(pterosaur screeches)

00:02:07.763 --> 00:02:09.598
(screeches)

00:02:14.478 --> 00:02:16.605
Uh... Buck.

00:02:16.689 --> 00:02:17.565
(gasps)

00:02:17.648 --> 00:02:19.525
(all screeching)

00:02:26.824 --> 00:02:28.576
(pterosaur screeches,
Eddie screams)

00:02:28.659 --> 00:02:29.660
BUCK:
Yah!

00:02:29.743 --> 00:02:32.079
(Buck yelling, Eddie screams)

00:02:32.163 --> 00:02:34.874
EDDIE:
No, no, no, Buck, Buck, wait, wait!

00:02:34.957 --> 00:02:35.958
Sid's that way.

00:02:36.041 --> 00:02:37.710
Tell that to them.

00:02:37.793 --> 00:02:39.545
(screeching)

00:02:39.628 --> 00:02:42.047
Bring it on, you chicken-headed freaks!

00:02:42.131 --> 00:02:42.965
(groans)

00:02:43.048 --> 00:02:44.800
(all hissing)

00:02:44.884 --> 00:02:46.385
(Manny straining)

00:02:50.473 --> 00:02:51.474
(grunting)

00:02:55.603 --> 00:02:57.229
(all whimpering)

00:02:59.607 --> 00:03:01.525
-(breathing heavily)
-Don't worry about a thing.

00:03:01.609 --> 00:03:03.611
You're doing fine.

00:03:03.694 --> 00:03:04.570
(hissing)

00:03:04.653 --> 00:03:05.905
It's going great.

00:03:05.988 --> 00:03:08.407
Uh... excuse me.

00:03:08.491 --> 00:03:10.201
-(hisses)
-(grunts)

00:03:10.284 --> 00:03:11.410
Aah!

00:03:11.494 --> 00:03:12.453
Just keep breathing.

00:03:12.536 --> 00:03:13.454
(yells)

00:03:13.537 --> 00:03:14.663
Diego.

00:03:14.747 --> 00:03:17.500
Just breathe;
that's the important thing.

00:03:17.583 --> 00:03:18.417
Oh.

00:03:18.501 --> 00:03:20.211
(engine-like whooshing)

00:03:25.591 --> 00:03:27.885
Grab that ammo.

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:31.013
(both gasp)

00:03:31.096 --> 00:03:33.390
Bogey, three o'clock. Fire.

00:03:35.017 --> 00:03:36.602
(whooshing)

00:03:40.856 --> 00:03:41.732
(screeches)

00:03:41.815 --> 00:03:45.236
This... is... awesome!

00:03:48.239 --> 00:03:50.908
-Light it up!
-(screeches)

00:03:50.991 --> 00:03:53.285
-Yeah!
-Hasta la vista, birdie.

00:03:53.369 --> 00:03:55.120
(gasping)

00:03:58.499 --> 00:04:00.501
Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh.

00:04:00.584 --> 00:04:02.127
Aah!

00:04:02.211 --> 00:04:03.587
Aah, hoo, whoo!

00:04:05.422 --> 00:04:07.424
Let's get our sloth...

00:04:07.508 --> 00:04:08.801
We're hit! We're hit!

00:04:08.884 --> 00:04:10.511
Mayday, Mayday!

00:04:10.594 --> 00:04:12.972
We're losing altitude.

00:04:13.055 --> 00:04:14.139
Hold these.

00:04:15.474 --> 00:04:17.101
(blowing)

00:04:17.184 --> 00:04:19.061
Oh, it tastes like fish.

00:04:19.144 --> 00:04:21.605
Okay, that's just weird.

00:04:21.689 --> 00:04:22.773
(Crash and Eddie screaming)

00:04:22.856 --> 00:04:24.483
I love you, bro!

00:04:24.567 --> 00:04:25.776
I know!

00:04:25.859 --> 00:04:28.237
Snap out of it! Come on!

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:29.196
(pterosaur screeches)

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:31.198
-Pull!
-(all straining)

00:04:31.282 --> 00:04:33.784
(all yelling)

00:04:33.867 --> 00:04:37.162
(pterosaur zooms by
like roaring jet engine)

00:04:39.415 --> 00:04:43.294
This is the end of Sid the Sloth.

00:04:43.377 --> 00:04:45.754
(high-pitched scream fading)

00:04:45.838 --> 00:04:48.424
(scream growing louder)

00:04:48.507 --> 00:04:50.509
-(yells)
-(screeches)

00:04:50.593 --> 00:04:51.510
Help!

00:04:51.594 --> 00:04:52.845
No, Sid, it's me!

00:04:52.928 --> 00:04:54.763
-And me!
-And me!

00:04:54.847 --> 00:04:57.975
I-I don't want to panic anybody,
but who's flying this thing?!

00:04:58.058 --> 00:04:58.892
Oops!

00:05:03.105 --> 00:05:04.273
-Huh?
-Huh?

00:05:07.151 --> 00:05:08.777
(whooshing through air)

00:05:09.612 --> 00:05:11.238
(excited chittering)

00:05:11.905 --> 00:05:12.781
SID:
No, no, wait!

00:05:12.865 --> 00:05:14.116
Wait! My kids!

00:05:14.199 --> 00:05:15.868
(chittering)

00:05:15.951 --> 00:05:17.453
(dinosaur bellows)

00:05:17.536 --> 00:05:20.122
I never even got to say good-bye.

00:05:20.205 --> 00:05:22.374
(pterosaur squawks)

00:05:22.458 --> 00:05:24.877
-(rhythmic panting)
-You can do it! Push!

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:26.629
-(loud, sustained grunt)
-Push!

00:05:26.712 --> 00:05:27.880
I can't do it.

00:05:27.963 --> 00:05:29.840
Just one more big push.

00:05:29.923 --> 00:05:32.468
You have no idea
what I'm going through.

00:05:33.218 --> 00:05:34.762
Okay, forget I said that.

00:05:34.845 --> 00:05:36.847
Let's do this together.

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:38.724
(loud grunts)

00:05:38.807 --> 00:05:40.184
(squawks)

00:05:40.267 --> 00:05:41.894
(sputters)

00:05:41.977 --> 00:05:42.853
(screeching)

00:05:42.936 --> 00:05:44.772
(gasps)

00:05:45.522 --> 00:05:46.649
(muffled yell)

00:05:46.732 --> 00:05:49.234
I liked you guys better
when you were extinct!

00:05:49.318 --> 00:05:50.653
(yells)

00:05:50.736 --> 00:05:53.364
BOTH (panting):
Hee, hee, hoo, hoo, hee, hee, hoo...

00:05:53.447 --> 00:05:55.824
-Ooh-ah. Getting dizzy.
-(straining)

00:05:55.908 --> 00:05:57.242
(Manny grunts)

00:05:57.326 --> 00:05:58.702
Manny!

00:05:58.786 --> 00:05:59.787
Come on, buddy.

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:01.121
I think we're getting close.

00:06:01.205 --> 00:06:02.706
(strained grunting)

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:05.793
(baby crying in distance)

00:06:09.046 --> 00:06:11.006
(crying quiets)

00:06:12.466 --> 00:06:15.219
(baby sighs quietly)

